    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/74ae8586b80288aa486683b11f505d55.poster.avif?t=1629133505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/74ae8586b80288aa486683b11f505d55.webm?t=1629133505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/74ae8586b80288aa486683b11f505d55.mp4?t=1629133505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Bill Hates Videogames is a comedy misadventure where you get to play as Bill after he gets sucked into a videogame-like world.<br>Harness the power of Bill by eating trash, farting, and being lazy. Ok there is a talking sword that helps you and can transform into different weapons so that's pretty cool right?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/8b313dd582859b699d99f65d6578753c.poster.avif?t=1629133505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/8b313dd582859b699d99f65d6578753c.webm?t=1629133505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/8b313dd582859b699d99f65d6578753c.mp4?t=1629133505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Art style inspired by shows like Home Movies and Ed, Edd, n Eddy using a &quot;boiling line&quot; to make the world feel more alive and in-motion. <br><br><u>FEATURES</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore a cartoony world</strong> filled with odd characters that may ask you to do things for them<br></li><li><strong>Combat foes and bosses</strong> or don't! I'm not the boss of you<br></li><li><strong>Solve well-designed puzzles</strong> designed by a great designer<br></li><li><strong>Listen to a bouncy soundtrack</strong> filled with bops and tunes you'll be jamming to for a lifetime</li></ul><br>OTHER THINGS YOU CAN DO IN THIS VIDEOGAME<br>- Eat Trash<br>- A dedicated fart button<br>- A 3rd thing...<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/5dbc119dcfdcc497185fe103649691e5.poster.avif?t=1629133505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/5dbc119dcfdcc497185fe103649691e5.webm?t=1629133505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/5dbc119dcfdcc497185fe103649691e5.mp4?t=1629133505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><strong>Please follow and wishlist Bill Hates Videogames for updates and to know when the game is going to come out!</strong>",
