y a great designer<br></li><li><strong>Listen to a bouncy soundtrack</strong> filled with bops and tunes you'll be jamming to for a lifetime</li></ul><br>OTHER THINGS YOU CAN DO IN THIS VIDEOGAME<br>- Eat Trash<br>- A dedicated fart button<br>- A 3rd thing...<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/5dbc119dcfdcc497185fe103649691e5.poster.avif?t=1629133505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/5dbc119dcfdcc497185fe103649691e5.webm?t=1629133505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370420/extras/5dbc119dcfdcc497185fe103649691e5.mp4?t=1629133505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><strong>Please follow and wishlist Bill Hates Videogames for updates and to know when the game is going to come out!</strong>",
